-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      NexClash differential verification against two machine-played
              recordings and unit cases over every graphic; simulated boot;
              run from its menu in OverSpec. Not on real hardware.

  Replay      two machine-played recordings (40181 frames, 14 games of the
              first level): every register with R and all memory at every
              hook, 111080 figures and 13019621 sprite pixels identical; 2352
              unit cases over all 49 graphics

  Emulator    OverSpec: from the patch menu, the loading screen, the game's
              menu and play

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
